    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces: Outside The Backrooms is a surrealist indie game with a PSX feel based on lucid dreaming and liminal spaces. The game mainly consists in exploring the dreamy surroundings of these psychedelic and minimalistic worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces: Outside The Backrooms is a surrealist first-person walking simulator game about dreams, featuring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* trippy, psychedelic visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* intense music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* and last but not least, an overarching feeling of NEVER knowing what to expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dreamy and psychedelic  world through PSX enviroments and liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It explores the idea of a mind losing its grasp with reality, as reality turns into a dream. Often it resembles an acid trip, or an interactive fever dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Retro game influenced by the BACKROOMS Aesthetic with a PLAYSTATION 1 feel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining a Walking Simulator with exploration, and trippy music, be prepared to confront your deepest thoughts in this mental challenge between dreams and reality where nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A TOTAL experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces: Outside The Backrooms is a surrealist indie game with a PSX feel based on lucid dreaming and liminal spaces. The game mainly consists in exploring the dreamy surroundings of these psychedelic and minimalistic worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces: Outside The Backrooms is a surrealist first-person walking simulator game about dreams, featuring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* trippy, psychedelic visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* intense music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* and last but not least, an overarching feeling of NEVER knowing what to expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dreamy and psychedelic  world through PSX enviroments and liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It explores the idea of a mind losing its grasp with reality, as reality turns into a dream. Often it resembles an acid trip, or an interactive fever dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Retro game influenced by the BACKROOMS Aesthetic with a PLAYSTATION 1 feel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining a Walking Simulator with exploration, and trippy music, be prepared to confront your deepest thoughts in this mental challenge between dreams and reality where nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A TOTAL experience.</p>",
